                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Conger, Goodnow, and Seaman to Mr.
                    Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-10-08"><hi rendition="#italic">October 8,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Messrs. Conger, Goodnow, and Seaman report that the treaty with China has been
                    signed.)</p>
